Spec: LinkGate native owner presentation

Purpose:
  Render a consistent accessible mobile interface without transport or authority decisions.

Owns:
  ./OwnerUi.java

Must:
  Provide native rounded cards, semantic icons, typography and button states using a restrained teal and navy palette.
  Keep at least forty-eight density-independent pixels for touch targets, support font scaling and constrain reading width on wide devices.
  Accept action callbacks only; never read identity storage, start networking, approve permissions or mutate gateway state.
